Keep a shared ugly as 0.

To test from value (a whole number).
If value is 1, set ugly to 1, return.
If value modulo 2 is 0, test from value divided by 2, return.
If value modulo 3 is 0, test from value divided by 3, return.
If value modulo 5 is 0, test from value divided by 5, return.

The want is 10.
The count is 0.
The candidate is 0.
Repeat while count is less than want.
Add 1 to candidate.
Set ugly to 0.
Test from candidate.
If ugly is 1, add 1 to count.

Show candidate.
